              "@type": "Service",
              "name": "Austenitic & Martensitic Lost-Wax Casting",
              "description": "Lost-wax investment casting for 304, 316, and 410 grade alloys producing near-net geometries with ISO 8062 CT5–CT7 tolerances."
            }
          },
          {
